DEMO AGENT
[/] Autonomous AI agent powered by Groq (Llama 3.3 70B).
[/] Discovers APIs from the AgentMesh catalog and pays for them autonomously via x402.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SETUP
    1. Install dependencies
            cd agent
            npm install
    2. Configure environment
            cp .env.example .env
            # Fill in:
            #   GROQ_API_KEY         — from https://console.groq.com/keys
            #   AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY    — wallet private key with USDC balance
            #   FACILITATOR_ADDRESS  — X402Facilitator contract address
            # (optional) DEBUG=true  — enable HTTP request logging
    3. Make sure the backend is running
            cd apps/backend && pnpm dev
    4. Run the agent
            node agent-groq.mjs
            # or with a custom task:
            node agent-groq.mjs "What is the BTC/ETH ratio and is gas cheap right now?"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HOW IT WORKS
    1. Agent fetches the catalog from GET /api/v1/catalog
    2. Catalog is converted to Groq‑compatible function/tool definitions
    3. Agent sends the task + tools to Groq (free tier)
    4. Groq decides which APIs to call (no hardcoding)
    5. Agent executes each call with x402 payment (signs autonomously)
    6. Results are sent back to Groq
    7. Groq synthesizes a final analysis
    8. Zero human interaction throughout
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REQUIREMENTS
    - Node.js 18+
    - AgentMesh backend running (pnpm dev in apps/backend)
    - Agent wallet with USDC balance (use faucet if needed)
    - Groq API key (free tier available)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EXAMPLE TASKS
    node agent-groq.mjs "Analyze the crypto market and give me a trading recommendation"
    node agent-groq.mjs "What is the current gas price and is it a good time to transact?"
    node agent-groq.mjs "Compare BTC and ETH performance and calculate their ratio"
    node agent-groq.mjs "Give me a full market overview of all available crypto prices"
    node agent-groq.mjs "Tell me a cat fact"
